{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"23ffab91632953ab","x":-460,"y":-360,"width":300,"height":129,"type":"text","text":"[[The Age of Arcanum.canvas]]\n[[Divina Cilindrath.canvas]]\n[[Verazanoth.canvas]]\n#Lore "},
		{"id":"7cd2d8bf7b830ce2","x":-460,"y":-200,"width":825,"height":480,"type":"text","text":"This nation began to rise around the same time as Armount and is the reason it floated in the skies as the Cilindrathies were the first to discover and utilize brimstone. They were able to make ships that once soured through the skies, eventually creating the technology that was sold to Armount allowing to float. \n\nFounded by a woman named Divina Cilindrath this nation prospered during the Age of Arcanum and were experts in the use of a local resource that could only be found within the lorded over vicinity of it. Also being the capital nation it is where the council of Wildfort lived. Divina and 6 others created the continent and all its cities during this period using the airships made from brimstone to fast track all imports and exports within the continent. \n\n\nDivina was a arcanist and unlike most in this aera she proposed peace and was against both unethical research and war. Her ideals were highly respected and so the council was very well received by the masses.  \n\nCilindrath was a hub for trade and is the first nation of entry into the continent of Wildfort. \n\nBecause of their weak military Cilindrath was taken over by the once in hiding Unhileg. But nobody has any idea what happened to Divina or the rest of the council.\n\nDivina is a descendant of the Lumiere bloodline although she and every other being in existence was unaware of that fact."}
	],
	"edges":[]
}